==Overview ==
Toilet Man is an [[Exclusive]] Unit in Toilet Tower Defense. It is added in the [[Shop|Exclusive Shop]].

==Appearance==
A [[Mutant Toilet (Unit)|Mutant Toilet]] with the Roblox default face and human legs. He has a white toilet and gray shorts on his legs and has no hands.

== Obtainment ==
The [[Toilet Man]] can be bought in the [[Shop]] for a price of [[File:Robux.png|25px]]499. It can also be traded for in the [[Trading Plaza]] or bought in the [[Marketplace]] or being gifted from the [[Post Office]].

==Value==
The current trading value of Toilet Man is 1.7-4.15K gems. The player demand for this unit is rated at 6/10, and the price stability is Unstable.

